<p>Follow these steps to delete a one click preset.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>You can only delete one click presets with the 
 <img alt="" class="help-icon" height="16" loading="lazy" src="~/images/help/NOT_SHARED_ICON.gif" width="16"/> icon.</p></li>
</ul>
<ol>
<li><p>Open the printing preferences dialog box.</p></li>
<li><p>Click <span class="Term-Soft">Manage...</span> on 
 the <span class="Term-Soft">Frequently Used Settings</span> tab. The <span class="Term-Soft">Manage One Click Preset List</span> dialog box appears.</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start="3">
<li><p>Select the one click preset name which you want 
 to delete, and then click <span class="Term-Soft">Delete</span>.</p></li>
</ol>
<div class="help-step-extra">
<ul>
<li><p class="Normal-indent">You cannot 
 delete the system-provided one click preset.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
<ol start="4">
<li><p>When a confirmation message appears, click <span class="Term-Soft">Yes</span>.</p></li>
<li><p>Click <span class="Term-Soft">OK</span> to close 
 the <span class="Term-Soft">Manage One Click Preset List</span> dialog box.</p></li>
</ol>
